msgstr "ल्यापटपको CPU थ्रोटल सक्षम पार्दछ"

#: power.cpp:183 power.cpp:276
msgid "How much to throttle the laptop's CPU"
msgstr "ल्यापटपको CPU कति थ्रोटल गर्ने"

#: power.cpp:199 power.cpp:289
msgid "Don't act if LAV is >"
msgstr "Don't act if LAV is >"

#: power.cpp:202 power.cpp:292
msgid ""
"If enabled and the system load average is greater than this value none of "
"the above options will be applied"
msgstr ""
"यदि लागू गरिएको र प्रणाली लोड औसत यो मान भन्दा बढि छ भने माथिको विकल्प मध्य कुनै लागू "
"गरिने छैन"

#: power.cpp:208
msgid "&Wait for:"
msgstr "यसका लागि प्रतिक्षा गर्नुहोस्:"

